WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.443
DANGER. Show unseen germs in a dirty water source.

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:07.611
DISEASE. Label cholera, typhoid and diarrhoeal illness.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:11.181
PREVENT. Use safe treated water and handwashing.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.991
HELP. Tell adult early about severe illness or dehydration.
